{"seq":3,"slug":"penalty-liability-supply-chain-enforcement","title":"违规罚则、连带责任与跨境执法链路","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/eudr-deforestation-free-supply-chain-due-diligence/eudr-regime-legal-model/penalty-liability-supply-chain-enforcement","wordCount":3048,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"违规罚则-连带责任与跨境执法链路\">违规罚则、连带责任与跨境执法链路</h1><p>欧盟零毁林法案（EUDR，Regulation (EU) 2023/1115）最容易被低估的部分不是尽职调查本身，而是<strong>违规之后谁付钱、付多少、以及主管机关如何跨越成员国边境追到货</strong>。第 25 条把罚则留给各成员国自行立法，同时用最低标准封住下限；第 24 条把检查强度绑定到国别风险分级；第 4、12、26、33 条则把一份尽职调查声明（DDS）的引用编号变成了海关放行的硬门槛。对跨境电商工程团队而言，这三层叠起来意味着：系统的价值不在于&quot;生成一份声明&quot;，而在于让每一次申报都能在事后被追溯到一份可辩护的证据链，并把罚则暴露量当成可计算的量来管理。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>本文引用的条款号、百分比与时间线均来自 Regulation (EU) 2023/1115 与欧洲委员会/欧洲议会公开材料（见文末来源），请以最新合并文本为准。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本文围绕四个互相咬合的机制展开，先厘清它们各自的定义，后文再逐层展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>罚则下界（第 25 条）</strong>——成员国必须设立的罚则类别，含罚款、没收、采购排斥、临时市场禁令等；罚款最高额的下限为违规主体在欧盟境内年营业额的 4%。</li>\n<li><strong>风险分级检查（第 24 条）</strong>——主管机关按国别风险等级执行的最低检查比例：高风险 9%、标准风险 3%、低风险 1%。</li>\n<li><strong>责任传导（第 4、12 条）</strong>——经营者提交 DDS 并取得引用编号，下游贸易商引用上游编号完成合规，责任随之沿链路转移。</li>\n<li><strong>跨境执法链路（第 26、33 条）</strong>——信息系统集中登记 DDS，海关申报携带引用编号，把企业内部合规变成货物跨境流动的通行证。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"一-第-25-条罚则的法定构造\">一、第 25 条罚则的法定构造</h2><p>第 25 条不设统一罚款金额，而是要求每个成员国建立一个&quot;有效、相称且具有威慑力&quot;的罚则体系，并<strong>至少</strong>覆盖下列类别。这是欧委会为保持对各成员国法律传统的尊重而做的刻意留白，代价是同一违规在波兰和荷兰可能面对完全不同的金额区间。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>罚则类别</th>\n<th>第 25 条要求的最低内容</th>\n<th>工程/合规影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>罚款</td>\n<td>与环境和货物价值相称、具威慑力，且<strong>最高额不低于违规经营者/贸易商在欧盟境内年营业额的 4%</strong></td>\n<td>罚款上限随企业规模浮动，需按主体口径归集&quot;欧盟营业额&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>没收</td>\n<td>没收违规产品，以及从违规交易中取得的收入</td>\n<td>需能证明特定批次的价值与流转路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采购排斥</td>\n<td>将违规者排除出公共采购程序</td>\n<td>政府/公立客户资质审查会回查合规记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>临时禁令</td>\n<td>暂时禁止在欧盟市场上投放或出口相关产品或商品</td>\n<td>直接中断店铺上架与出口履约</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>简化程序资格</td>\n<td>撤销其在低风险国别下享受的简化尽职调查待遇</td>\n<td>合规成本从&quot;简化&quot;跳回&quot;标准&quot;档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>撤回/召回</td>\n<td>要求立即撤回或召回不合规产品</td>\n<td>触发逆向物流与库存核销</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键在于 <strong>4% 是下限而非固定值</strong>：成员国既可以设得更高，也可以按企业规模分级。欧洲议会表决时的表述是&quot;最高罚款至少为该经营者或贸易商欧盟年营业额的 4%&quot;，这意味着罚则暴露量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{fine}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是一个以欧盟口径营业额为基数的区间下界，而不是一个可直接代入的常数。对一家年欧盟营收 2 亿欧元的进口商，仅罚款一项的名义下界就是 800 万欧元，尚未计入没收货物价值与召回成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"二-检查强度由国别风险分级决定-第-24-条\">二、检查强度由国别风险分级决定（第 24 条）</h2><p>第 24 条要求成员国主管机关按国别风险等级设定<strong>最低检查比例</strong>。这意味着&quot;被查到&quot;不是随机事件，而是由商品原产国被分到哪一档决定的概率函数。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>国别风险等级</th>\n<th>主管机关最低检查比例</th>\n<th>对经营者尽职调查的要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高风险</td>\n<td>9%</td>\n<td>完整尽职调查，须取得地理坐标等原始证据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标准风险</td>\n<td>3%</td>\n<td>完整尽职调查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低风险</td>\n<td>1%</td>\n<td>可适用简化尽职调查程序</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>国别分级由欧委会通过实施条例按客观、透明的评估方法确定，并在法规生效后 18 个月内完成；主管机关在检查中可使用地理定位数据、卫星监测与 DNA 分析等手段来验证&quot;无毁林&quot;声明。把检查比例折算成风险，可以把&quot;预期被检查概率&quot;写成国别风险 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 的函数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0.09</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>high</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0.03</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>standard</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0.01</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>low</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q(r) = \\begin{cases} 0.09 &amp; r = \\text{high} \\\\ 0.03 &amp; r = \\text{standard} \\\\ 0.01 &amp; r = \\text{low} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.32em;vertical-align:-1.91em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.192em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.09</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.03</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">high</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">standard</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">low</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>工程含义很直接：同一个 SKU 若从低风险国换到高风险国采购，其被检查概率放大 9 倍，系统必须据此重新计算合规资源的投入优先级，而不是对全部供应国一视同仁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三-连带责任链路-dds-是责任凭证而非收据\">三、连带责任链路：DDS 是责任凭证而非收据</h2><p>EUDR 的责任并非只压在&quot;把货带进欧盟的人&quot;身上。法规区分<strong>经营者（operator）<strong>与</strong>贸易商（trader）</strong>：把受管制商品首次投放欧盟市场或从欧盟出口的主体是经营者，必须执行完整尽职调查并提交 DDS；下游贸易商在绝大多数情形下可以<strong>引用上游已提交的 DDS 编号</strong>来证明合规，而不必自己做一遍地理定位分析。这一设计制造了一条清晰的责任传导链，也是整个体系最脆弱的接缝。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;生产地块&lt;br/&gt;地理坐标 + 无毁林证据&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;经营者&lt;br/&gt;完整尽职调查 Art 10&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;提交 DDS&lt;br/&gt;信息系统 Art 12/33 取回引用编号&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;上游 DDS 编号&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;下游贸易商&lt;br/&gt;引用上游编号&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;海关申报&lt;br/&gt;引用 DDS 编号 Art 4(2)/26&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;成员国主管机关检查&lt;br/&gt;Art 24 按风险比例抽查&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H{&quot;合规?&quot;}&#10;    H --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| I[&quot;放行 / 进入欧盟市场&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| J[&quot;第 25 条罚则&lt;br/&gt;罚款/没收/禁令/召回&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"生产地块&lt;br/&gt;地理坐标 + 无毁林证据\"] --&gt; B[\"经营者&lt;br/&gt;完整尽职调查 Art 10\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"提交 DDS&lt;br/&gt;信息系统 Art 12/33 取回引用编号\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"上游 DDS 编号\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"下游贸易商&lt;br/&gt;引用上游编号\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"海关申报&lt;br/&gt;引用 DDS 编号 Art 4(2)/26\"]\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[\"成员国主管机关检查&lt;br/&gt;Art 24 按风险比例抽查\"]\n    G --&gt; H{\"合规?\"}\n    H --&gt;|\"是\"| I[\"放行 / 进入欧盟市场\"]\n    H --&gt;|\"否\"| J[\"第 25 条罚则&lt;br/&gt;罚款/没收/禁令/召回\"]</pre><p>链条的含义是<strong>责任随引用而转移</strong>：下游贸易商引用一条虚假或过期的 DDS 编号，自己就落入了违规区间——这也是为什么&quot;供应商给的编号&quot;不能直接当信任边界，而必须能验证其有效性、批次对得上、且仍处于有效状态。任何一处断链，罚则都会沿着这条图向下游蔓延。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四-跨境执法链路-从信息系统到海关\">四、跨境执法链路：从信息系统到海关</h2><p>EUDR 的执法并不停留在单一成员国的境内检查，而是由三个机制把链路拉过边境：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>EUDR 信息系统（第 33 条）</strong>——欧委会的集中 DDS 登记库，2024 年 12 月 4 日启用、同年 11 月起开放用户注册。DDS 在系统中生成唯一引用编号，成为后续所有核验的锚点。</li>\n<li><strong>海关链路（第 4(2)、26 条）</strong>——商品进入或离开欧盟关境时，海关申报须携带 DDS 的引用编号，海关据此与信息系统比对，并在放行环节执行风险导向的检查。这条链路把&quot;合规&quot;从企业内部文件变成了跨境物理流动的通行证。</li>\n<li><strong>主管机关与相互协助（第 27 条）</strong>——各成员国须指定主管机关，并支持法规在整个欧盟范围内协调实施与执法；成员国之间就跨境违规线索进行协助，避免&quot;在成员国 A 被查、从成员国 B 报关&quot;的套利。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>时间线是 2026 年最需要盯住的变量。经 2024 年 12 月与 2025 年 12 月的简化修正案后，现行适用日期为：大中型经营者 <strong>2026 年 12 月 30 日</strong>，微型与小型经营者 <strong>2027 年 6 月 30 日</strong>，而原本已受 EUTR 约束的微型与小型经营者回到 <strong>2026 年 12 月 30 日</strong>。此外，经 Commission Delegated Regulation (EU) 2026/2102 新增的产品（可溶性咖啡、部分棕榈油衍生物、冷冻牛舌等）自 <strong>2027 年 12 月 30 日</strong>起适用。EUDR 同时废止了原有的《欧盟木材条例》（EUTR），意味着木材类目下的旧合规资产需要迁移而非续用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"五-工程含义-把罚则暴露量做成可计算量\">五、工程含义：把罚则暴露量做成可计算量</h2><p>如果罚则只写进合规手册，它就永远只是文字。真正降低风险的做法是把&quot;预期执法成本&quot;写进系统指标，让它在选品、供应商准入和库存决策里参与排序。一个可落地的一阶模型是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mn>0.04</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>U</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[C] = q(r)\\cdot\\Big(\\max\\big(0.04\\cdot R_{EU},\\, F_{min}\\big) + V_{conf} + V_{recall}\\Big) + (1-q(r))\\cdot C_{DD}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0.04</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q(r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是第二节给出的按国别风险的检查概率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>U</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{EU}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该主体在欧盟口径的年营业额，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是成员国设定的最低罚款额，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{conf}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是被没收货物与违规收入的期望价值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{recall}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是撤回/召回的期望成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{DD}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是执行尽职调查的固定成本。这个式子给出的最有用结论不是精确金额，而是<strong>排序</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q(r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 从 1% 升到 9% 时，重罚项被放大 9 倍，高风险国别供应商的尽调预算优先级应当被系统性抬高；而当 4% 下界以&quot;欧盟营业额&quot;为基数时，同一违规对不同规模主体的绝对冲击差异巨大，收入归集口径本身就成了风控对象。</p>\n<p>落到系统设计上，支撑这条可计算链路的最小要求有三条：<strong>一是可追溯</strong>——每一份 DDS 引用编号、其关联批次、地理位置证据与提交时间必须可回查，且能在被抽查时导出为可直接核验的形态；<strong>二是可验证</strong>——不能把&quot;上游给的编号&quot;当信任边界，要在入库时校验其有效性、批次匹配与状态（是否被撤销、是否在简化档），把引用失效当作风险事件而非数据错误；<strong>三是可对账</strong>——海关申报编号、DDS 编号与内部 SKU/批次号三者要能双向映射，才能在事后证明&quot;这一票货对得起这份声明&quot;。把第 25 条的罚则翻译成这三条工程约束，才是把法律责任真正嵌进系统而不是贴在文档上的方式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>EUDR 的罚则体系有三条应被记住的骨架：罚款下界以&quot;欧盟年营业额的 4%&quot;为基数、检查概率由国别风险分级（9%/3%/1%）决定、责任沿 DDS 引用链向下游传导并最终在海关环节收口。对跨境电商工程团队，可操作的动作是把这三条转成系统能力——按主体口径归集欧盟营业额以量化罚款暴露量，按国别风险重排尽调预算，把 DDS 引用的有效性与批次匹配当作硬校验而非事后核对。时间线上，大中型经营者 2026 年 12 月 30 日、多数微小型 2027 年 6 月 30 日、经 (EU) 2026/2102 新增产品 2027 年 12 月 30 日起适用，倒排系统交付节点应以此为锚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"来源与核验\">来源与核验</h2><ul>\n<li>Regulation (EU) 2023/1115（EUDR）合并文本，第 4(2)、10、12、24、25、26、27、33 条 · <a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2023/1115/oj/eng\">EUR-Lex</a></li>\n<li>欧洲议会新闻稿：最高罚款&quot;至少为该经营者或贸易商欧盟年营业额的 4%&quot;，检查比例 高风险 9% / 标准 3% / 低风险 1% · <a href=\"https://www.europarl.europa.eu/news/en/press-room/20230414IPR80129/deforestation-regulation-meps-adopt-landmark-law\">European Parliament</a></li>\n<li>欧委会 EUDR 实施页：适用日期（大中型 2026-12-30、微小型 2027-06-30、原 EUTR 覆盖微小型 2026-12-30）、Delegated Regulation (EU) 2026/2102 新增产品 2027-12-30、信息系统 2024-12-04 启用、EUTR 废止 · <a href=\"https://environment.ec.europa.eu/topics/forests/deforestation/regulation-deforestation-free-products_en\">European Commission</a></li>\n<li>欧委会 EUDR 实施与主管机关页：成员国指定主管机关、信息系统提交与年度检查 · <a href=\"https://green-forum.ec.europa.eu/deforestation-regulation-implementation_en\">European Commission — EUDR implementation</a></li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>本章其他文档的分工与索引见 <a href=\"../\">本章索引</a>；本 hub 的整体定位与学习路径见 hub 引言。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"违规罚则、连带责任与跨境执法链路","id":"违规罚则-连带责任与跨境执法链路"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"一、第 25 条罚则的法定构造","id":"一-第-25-条罚则的法定构造"},{"level":2,"text":"二、检查强度由国别风险分级决定（第 24 条）","id":"二-检查强度由国别风险分级决定-第-24-条"},{"level":2,"text":"三、连带责任链路：DDS 是责任凭证而非收据","id":"三-连带责任链路-dds-是责任凭证而非收据"},{"level":2,"text":"四、跨境执法链路：从信息系统到海关","id":"四-跨境执法链路-从信息系统到海关"},{"level":2,"text":"五、工程含义：把罚则暴露量做成可计算量","id":"五-工程含义-把罚则暴露量做成可计算量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"来源与核验","id":"来源与核验"}],"prev":{"title":"毁林基准日、零毁林与合法性的法律判定模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/eudr-deforestation-free-supply-chain-due-diligence/eudr-regime-legal-model/deforestation-cutoff-baseline-legal-test"},"next":{"title":"地块地理定位数据模型：坐标精度、多边形与 GeoJSON 规范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/eudr-deforestation-free-supply-chain-due-diligence/parcel-geolocation-traceability-data/parcel-geolocation-data-model"}}